WHAT THIS COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

The licence above applies to the CODE in this repository - the scripts, the
app, the tests - which is the part its author wrote and can license.

It does NOT apply to the contents of `data/`, and it cannot. Those files are
derived from public community sources (Serebii, pokebase.app, Pikalytics,
Smogon and pokedata.ovh) and describe a game owned by someone else. They are
here so one player's own box is searchable, not to be redistributed as a
dataset.

Pokemon and all respective names are trademarks of Nintendo, Creatures Inc.
and GAME FREAK Inc. This is an unaffiliated fan project. Nothing in it is sold
or advertised.
